# Inprogress Articles & Presentations
Demonstrations/Papers/
Demonstrations/SharedAssets/

# Junctions inside each Slidev project's public/ that mirror the ignored
# SharedAssets/Papers folders above (created so <img> tags can resolve them
# via Vite's public-dir convention) -- must be ignored separately since git
# doesn't know they're the same content at a different path.
Demonstrations/Presentations/*/public/SharedAssets/
Demonstrations/Presentations/*/public/PapersResources/

# Slidev / Vue generated artifacts
Demonstrations/Presentations/*/node_modules/
Demonstrations/Presentations/*/dist/
Demonstrations/Presentations/*/.slidev/
Demonstrations/Presentations/*/package-lock.json

